# BMW 3 Series F30 four-door saloon, 2011-2019.
#
# The F30 3-series: 4,624 mm long, 1,811 mm wide, 1,429 mm high, 2,810 mm
# wheelbase; 1.5-3.0 petrol and 2.0 diesel, the 320d the volume fleet model.
# Facelift (LCI) in 2015. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BMW_3_Series_(F30)
#
# Colours: Black Sapphire, Glacier Silver, Estoril Blue and Alpine White are
# documented BMW finishes of the period.
#
# Weight: 200 in total (black 70, silver 55, blue 40, white 35), the 3-series the
# strongest class-3 seller of the 2010s.
#
# Speed 240 km/h; comfort 135/533 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 2011-2019 with a road tail to about 2030.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bmw-f30.blend. References:
# citycars/references/bmw-f30/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

